---
const title = 'Terms of Service | Orchestrix';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Terms of Service for Orchestrix." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="document-page">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Orchestrix home"><span aria-hidden="true">◈</span> Orchestrix</a>
      <article aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to sign up</a>
        <h1 id="page-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>
        <p>These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of Orchestrix. By creating an account or using the service, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use Orchestrix.</p>
        <h2>Using Orchestrix</h2>
        <p>You must provide accurate account information and keep your sign-in details secure. You are responsible for activity under your account and for using the service in compliance with applicable laws.</p>
        <h2>Your content</h2>
        <p>You retain the rights to content you submit. You grant Orchestrix permission to host, process, and display that content only as needed to operate and provide the service.</p>
        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>Do not misuse Orchestrix, interfere with its operation, attempt unauthorized access, or use it to violate another person’s rights or the law.</p>
        <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
        <p>We may update or change the service. We may also update these Terms; when changes are material, we will take reasonable steps to notify you. Continued use after an update means you accept the revised Terms.</p>
        <h2>Suspension and termination</h2>
        <p>You may stop using Orchestrix at any time. We may suspend or end access when reasonably necessary to protect the service, its users, or comply with law.</p>
        <h2>Disclaimers and liability</h2>
        <p>To the extent permitted by law, Orchestrix is provided “as is” without warranties, and we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the service. Nothing in these Terms limits rights or remedies that cannot legally be limited.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms, contact the Orchestrix team through the channel provided with the service.</p>
      </article>
      <footer><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/login">Log in</a></footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { min-width: 320px; min-height: 100%; color-scheme: dark; background: #000; }
  :global(body) { min-width: 320px; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; color: #ededed; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0, #111 0, #050505 35rem, #000 75rem); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  .document-page { width: min(100% - 40px, 760px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 0 48px; }
  .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 38px; color: #f5f5f5; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.35px; text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark span { font-size: 21px; }
  article { padding: clamp(24px, 6vw, 48px); border: 1px solid #292929; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(8, 8, 8, .88); box-shadow: 0 20px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35); }
  .back-link, footer a { color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; }
  .back-link:hover, footer a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }
  h1 { margin: 28px 0 6px; font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -1.4px; }
  .updated { margin: 0 0 28px; color: #777; font-size: 12px; }
  article p { color: #bbb; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; }
  h2 { margin: 30px 0 8px; color: #f5f5f5; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  h2 + p { margin-top: 0; }
  footer { padding: 20px 4px; text-align: center; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #3291ff; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
